flowchart TB
  accTitle: 所有在线外呼共用一份 AttemptBudget
  accDescr: 请求开始即创建 AttemptBudget。需要任务分析时先消耗辅助调用、总出站、截止时间和成本预算，随后 ExecutionPlan 固定剩余预算；主回答、视觉、重试和模型或 Target 切换继续共用它。预算不足立即结束，ClientCommit 后禁止重试和切换。响应后的异步评测使用独立预算，不在本图内。

  BUDGET["请求开始创建 AttemptBudget<br/>主回答次数 · 辅助调用次数<br/>总外呼 · 每 Target 重试<br/>Target / 模型切换<br/>deadline · 最坏成本"] --> NEED_ANALYSIS{"需要任务分析器？"}
  NEED_ANALYSIS -->|"是"| ANALYZER["先占用辅助 / 总外呼<br/>deadline / 成本"] --> PLAN["ExecutionPlan<br/>固定剩余预算"]
  NEED_ANALYSIS -->|"否"| PLAN
  PLAN --> CHECK{"发送前检查"}
  CHECK -->|"超限"| STOP["结束请求"]
  CHECK -->|"允许"| DISPATCH["记录计数并 dispatch"]
  DISPATCH --> EVENT{"收到完整合法<br/>协议事件？"}
  EVENT -->|"是"| COMMIT["ClientCommit"] --> STREAM["继续返回<br/>禁止重试或切换"]
  EVENT -->|"否，可恢复"| NEXT{"计划内还有<br/>下一次尝试？"}
  EVENT -->|"否，不可恢复"| STOP
  NEXT -->|"是"| CHECK
  NEXT -->|"否"| STOP

  classDef primary fill:#f7fbfd,color:#172229,stroke:#526f7e,stroke-width:1.5px;
  classDef budget fill:#e8f2ff,color:#172229,stroke:#3f75a3,stroke-width:1.5px;
  classDef decision fill:#fff4e7,color:#172229,stroke:#965b15,stroke-width:1.5px;
  classDef runtime fill:#e7f7f6,color:#172229,stroke:#2d7774,stroke-width:1.5px;
  classDef commit fill:#eaf6ee,color:#172229,stroke:#34794b,stroke-width:2px;
  classDef terminal fill:#fff0f1,color:#172229,stroke:#a34752,stroke-width:1.5px;
  class PLAN primary;
  class BUDGET budget;
  class NEED_ANALYSIS,CHECK,EVENT,NEXT decision;
  class ANALYZER,DISPATCH runtime;
  class COMMIT,STREAM commit;
  class STOP terminal;
